Freeze confirmatory protocol v1.0 before any confirmatory read

Prespecified design for the confirmatory study (Claude Opus 5.5 and GPT vs DeepCAC):
100 never-used NLST participants (25 per Agatston stratum, seed 2026), contiguous
2.5-mm rendering, identical prompt, 200 audited reads per model (100 main + 20x5
dedicated reliability reads), primary noninferiority of sensitivity for any CAC
(margin 10 points, Newcombe paired 97.5% CI). Sampling, download, rendering and
analysis code frozen with the protocol; analysis code dry-run on pilot data only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
